 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "totalSlots slots in a circle start empty. requests are [type, startIndex, numberOfSlots] strings. store: from startIndex scan candidate positions circularly; the first position p whose numberOfSlots consecutive circular slots are all free is used and p returned; -1 if none of the totalSlots positions works. free (inferred second type): mark the numberOfSlots circular slots starting at startIndex free and return how many of them were in use.",
